  "question": {
    "text": "If the length of the&nbsp;latus rectum of a&nbsp;parabola, whose focus is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and the tangent at its vertex is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></math>, is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mi>a</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to",
